WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
My career was of Tulane University.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.780
I went to work in a shipyard.

3
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:14.340
Then I worked . . . I was in the [United States] Army Air Corps for about four years.

4
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:26.260
Served . . . I was trained at Yale, then went to British Guiana, South America, then went to Guam.

5
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:37.460
I was at Guam about the time of the Japanese surrender, and spent a year after the end of the war.

6
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:45.860
So when I came back, I had to decide if . . . keep following engineering, or get in the family paper business.

7
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:50.660
I decided that the paper business had better opportunities in New Orleans.

8
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.860
So is this . . . what year is this?
